  "details": "Discord recently added a ignore feature so certain friends can be ignored without them knowing  and so the user doesn't have to block them which can start drama with other people. I propose a moderate feature where when ignore is pressed, it mutes notifications from players you may be friends with, but spam too much or might cause drama when your in a room with them together. The other player won't know, and it wouldn't start any fights, and help keep notifications clear from friends from spam inviting.",
